# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: HyralArc | Scene: HyralOrc

translate pt strings:

    old "A head taller than the tallest man she had ever seen in her life."
    new "Uma cabeça mais alta que a do homem mais alto que ela já vira na vida."

    old "A moment of warmth...and this was the price they would pay for it."
    new "Um momento de calor... e este era o preço que pagariam por isso."

    old "A gate, a few watch towers, all made from what seemed like scavenged material."
    new "Uma porta, algumas torres de vigia, tudo feito do que parecia ser material recuperado."

    old "A collar, as meant for an animal."
    new "Um colar, como o que se usa em animais."

    old "A human might use a cart, but they simply carried them on their shoulders."
    new "Um humano poderia usar um carroça, mas eles simplesmente os carregavam nos ombros."

    old "A few orcs muddled about, engaged in trivial work."
    new "Alguns orcs andavam confusos, ocupados com tarefas triviais."

    old "Escape with the goblin"
    new "Fuga com o goblino"

    old "Stay in the camp"
    new "Ficar no acampamento"
